flowchart LR
    UI[Chat UI action] --> TS[services/api/chat.ts sendMessage]
    TS --> IPC[conversation_generate args]
    IPC --> CMD[src-tauri conversation_engine::conversation_generate]
    CMD --> ROUTER[RouterEngine]
    ROUTER --> POLICY[PolicyEngine]
    POLICY --> RES[ResilienceEngine]
    RES --> MEM[MemoryEngine]
    MEM --> SEARCH[SearchEngine or governed search gateway]
    SEARCH --> OUT[Structured response content + meta + trace]
    OUT --> UIR[UI render success or visible error]